    <mxCell id="dr_tl" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;AI CODE-SLOP PARADOX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;2026 DORA Finding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;+40% More PRs Merged, Yet +28% More Prod Incidents&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Measuring lines of AI-generated code or PR count rewards &lt;b&gt;giant unreviewed PRs&lt;/b&gt; that spike rework and outages.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#DC2626;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;Vanity Throughput Trap&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="dr_tr" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#059669;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;THE 5-GAUGE BALANCE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#D1FAE5;color:#065F46;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Throughput × Stability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Pair Speed Gauges (1–3) With CFR &amp;amp; Rework Rate (4–5)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;The 5th DORA metric (&lt;b&gt;Deployment Rework Rate&lt;/b&gt;) catches AI-generated slop immediately if hotfixes rise.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;Elite DORA Quadrant&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="dr_bot" value="&lt;div style='width:832px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;background:#F8FAFC;border:1.4px solid #CBD5E1;border-radius:16px;padding:9px 13px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;MNEMONIC: M · E · T · R · I · C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Engineering Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Measure Small PRs (&amp;lt;250 LOC) • Enforce pass^5 CI • Track Lead Time • Rollback via Flags (&amp;lt;1m) • Inspect CFR • Cap Rework &amp;lt;5%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Never put &lt;b&gt;PR count or AI acceptance %&lt;/b&gt; on an executive slide — report these &lt;b&gt;5 balanced DORA gauges&lt;/b&gt; instead.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="788" width="836" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c1_T157" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#2563EB;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;◆ 30s STAFF+ INTERVIEW PITCH&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;&amp;ldquo;We measure AI productivity with the &lt;b&gt;5-metric DORA model&lt;/b&gt;—pairing deploy frequency and lead time against &lt;b&gt;Change Failure and Rework Rate&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

